{"id":"en-r-9h7qsa.de","jokeId":"en-r-9h7qsa","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line. Per adaptNote twenty quarters and five dollars became ten fifty-cent coins and five euros, the ten-dollar bill a ten-euro note (the change is again ten coins). Each new day is a wipe in the same bar; every throw, pick-up and hand-over is acted during its words.","title":"Das Wechselgeld","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Typ kommt in eine Kneipe und bestellt ein Bier.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Das macht fünf Euro,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"sagt der Wirt, und der Typ wirft zehn Fünfzig-Cent-Münzen auf den Boden.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Widerwillig hebt der Wirt die Münzen auf","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und serviert das Bier.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am nächsten Tag kommt der Typ in die Kneipe, bestellt ein Bier,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"wirft zehn Fünfzig-Cent-Münzen auf den Boden, und so weiter.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am Tag darauf wieder.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am vierten Tag bestellt er ein Bier","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und gibt dem Wirt einen Zehn-Euro-Schein.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Wirt nutzt seine Chance auf Rache, wirft zehn Fünfzig-Cent-Münzen auf den Boden und brüllt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Hier ist dein Wechselgeld, Mistkerl!","uncensored":"Hier ist dein Wechselgeld, Arschloch!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Typ schaut auf die Münzen und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich nehme noch ein Bier, bitte.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"throw"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"kneel"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"stand"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"glass","action":"give","to":"muzhik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"throw"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"kneel"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"throw"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"kneel"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"bar","transition":"wipe","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"money","action":"give","to":"barmen"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"hold"},{"type":"act","who":"barmen","act":"throw"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"coin","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"camera","shot":"close","on":"muzhik"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-b3n4or.en","jokeId":"en-r-b3n4or","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept; long narration split where the action changes so each shake and crowd reaction lands on its words. Both pilots are blind (dark glasses, white canes); the co-pilot wears a pilot cap instead of the army cap. The cockpit line is a two-shot on the pilots.","title":"Blind Pilots","location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Two blind pilots enter a plane.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"They have sunglasses and white sticks.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"As the plane starts to move, the passengers are uncomfortable.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The plane gains speed, but it stays on the ground.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The remaining runway gets smaller and smaller, and the plane is rushing towards a fence.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The passengers start shrieking","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and suddenly the plane lifts, avoiding the fence at the last second.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"All the passengers calm down, thinking it was a bad joke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"In the pilot cabin, the co-pilot turns to the pilot and says:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"You know what? One day they're going to scream too late, and we're all going to die.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["dark-glasses","aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"crowd":{"who":"passengers","size":"many"},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"seat-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"camera","shot":"wide"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"sit"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"light"},{"type":"crowd","react":"murmur"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"shake","sec":4,"strength":"light"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"shake","sec":5,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"crowd","react":"gasp"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"crowd","react":"scream"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"crowd","react":"calm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-b3n4or.ru","jokeId":"en-r-b3n4or","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, narration kept whole and split where the action changes. Both pilots blind (dark glasses, white canes), co-pilot in a pilot cap; the passengers are a crowd that murmurs, gasps, screams and calms down on cue.","title":"Слепые пилоты","location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Два слепых пилота входят в самолёт.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"У них тёмные очки и белые трости.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Самолёт трогается с места, и пассажирам становится не по себе.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Самолёт набирает скорость, но остаётся на земле.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Взлётная полоса становится всё короче и короче, и самолёт несётся прямо на забор.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Пассажиры начинают визжать,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"и вдруг самолёт взлетает, в последнюю секунду разминувшись с забором.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Все пассажиры успокаиваются, решив, что это была неудачная шутка.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"В кабине второй пилот поворачивается к первому и говорит:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Знаешь что? Однажды они закричат слишком поздно, и мы все погибнем.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["dark-glasses","aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"crowd":{"who":"passengers","size":"many"},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"seat-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"camera","shot":"wide"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"sit"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"light"},{"type":"crowd","react":"murmur"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"shake","sec":4,"strength":"light"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"shake","sec":5,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"crowd","react":"gasp"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"crowd","react":"scream"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"crowd","react":"calm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"en-r-b3n4or.de","jokeId":"en-r-b3n4or","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, narration kept whole and split where the action changes. Both pilots blind (dark glasses, white canes), co-pilot in a pilot cap; the passengers are a crowd that murmurs, gasps, screams and calms down on cue.","title":"Blinde Piloten","location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Zwei blinde Piloten betreten ein Flugzeug.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Sie haben Sonnenbrillen und weiße Stöcke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Als das Flugzeug losrollt, fühlen sich die Passagiere unwohl.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Das Flugzeug wird schneller, aber es bleibt am Boden.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die restliche Startbahn wird immer kürzer, und das Flugzeug rast auf einen Zaun zu.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Passagiere fangen an zu kreischen,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und plötzlich hebt das Flugzeug ab und verfehlt den Zaun in letzter Sekunde.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Alle Passagiere beruhigen sich und denken, es war ein schlechter Scherz.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Im Cockpit dreht sich der Copilot zum Piloten um und sagt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","text":"Weißt du was? Eines Tages werden sie zu spät schreien, und wir werden alle sterben.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"pilot","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"pilot"},"looks":{"sluzhivy":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["dark-glasses","aerodrome-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"crowd":{"who":"passengers","size":"many"},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","item":"white-cane","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-left","to":"seat-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"camera","shot":"wide"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","act":"sit"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"light"},{"type":"crowd","react":"murmur"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"shake","sec":4,"strength":"light"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"shake","sec":5,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"crowd","react":"gasp"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"crowd","react":"scream"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"shake","sec":3,"strength":"strong"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"crowd","react":"calm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"camera","shot":"two","on":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1lo14k2.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1lo14k2","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept (typo entgegen geflogen fixed); his thought 'macht nix, hab ja den Notschirm noch' became his own line after 'Denkt er:'. He jumps out of the plane, then the sky: pulling both chutes, panic, the workman with a wrench flies in. No parachute pack exists, requested.","title":"Der Notschirm","location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Springt ein Mann mit dem Fallschirm aus dem Flugzeug.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"exit":["muzhik"]},{"character":"narrator","text":"Nach einiger Zeit will er den Fallschirm öffnen, aber nichts passiert. Denkt er:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Macht nix, hab ja den Notschirm noch.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er will ihn öffnen, doch nichts tut sich.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"So langsam wird er panisch,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"als ihm plötzlich von unten ein Mann mit Werkzeugkiste entgegengeflogen kommt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Da fragt er ihn:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Sie schickt der Himmel, reparieren Sie Fallschirme?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Darauf dieser:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Nein, Gasleitungen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"aisle"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"jump"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"nebesa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"plumber"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}],"needs":[{"kind":"accessory","id":"parachute-pack","description":"a skydiver's parachute backpack with a ripcord handle on the chest strap","why":"the whole setup is him pulling the main and then the reserve chute and nothing opening"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1lo14k2.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1lo14k2","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; his thought became his own line after 'Думает:'. 'Sie schickt der Himmel' kept as heaven, not God. He jumps out of the plane, then the sky: pulling both chutes, panic, the workman with a wrench flies in. Parachute pack requested.","title":"Запасной парашют","location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Прыгает мужик с парашютом из самолёта.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"exit":["muzhik"]},{"character":"narrator","text":"Через какое-то время хочет раскрыть парашют, но ничего не происходит. Думает:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ничего страшного, есть же ещё запасной.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Хочет раскрыть его, но ничего не выходит.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Потихоньку его охватывает паника,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"как вдруг снизу ему навстречу летит мужик с ящиком для инструментов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Тогда он его спрашивает:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Вас мне небеса послали! Вы парашюты чините?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"А тот в ответ:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"Нет, газовые трубы.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"aisle"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"jump"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"nebesa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"plumber"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}],"needs":[{"kind":"accessory","id":"parachute-pack","description":"a skydiver's parachute backpack with a ripcord handle on the chest strap","why":"the whole setup is him pulling the main and then the reserve chute and nothing opening"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1lo14k2.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1lo14k2","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; his thought became his own line after 'He thinks:'. He jumps out of the plane, then the sky: pulling both chutes, panic, the workman with a wrench flies in. Parachute pack requested.","title":"The Reserve Chute","location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man jumps out of a plane with a parachute.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"exit":["muzhik"]},{"character":"narrator","text":"After a while he wants to open the parachute, but nothing happens. He thinks:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"No big deal, I've still got the reserve chute.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"He wants to open it, but nothing works.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Slowly he starts to panic,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"when suddenly a man with a toolbox comes flying up towards him from below.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"So he asks him:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Heaven sent you! Do you repair parachutes?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"And the man answers:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"barmen","text":"No, gas lines.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"samolet","cast":["muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"aisle"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"jump"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"nebesa","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","barmen":"plumber"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["helmet"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shrug"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"grab"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"point"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"pray-hands"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}],"needs":[{"kind":"accessory","id":"parachute-pack","description":"a skydiver's parachute backpack with a ripcord handle on the chest strap","why":"the whole setup is him pulling the main and then the reserve chute and nothing opening"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1s5wyg5.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1s5wyg5","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Source wording kept, every narrator cue included (sagt der Mann stolz, meint dieser, fragen ihn die anderen mitleidig); numbers as words. Four fathers sit (three muzhik doubles plus paren), each dressed for his employer; the nurse walks in to the first and over to the third; the fourth holds his head and trembles on cue.","title":"Der Wartesaal","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["muzhik-sosed","devushka","muzhik-ryzhy","paren","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"father","devushka":"nurse","muzhik-ryzhy":"father","paren":"father","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Vier Männer sitzen im Krankenhaus-Wartesaal, während ihre Frauen entbinden.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Krankenschwester kommt zum ersten:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Glückwunsch, Sie sind Vater von Zwillingen geworden!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Das passt ja,","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"sagt der Mann stolz.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Ich arbeite bei Zweirad Stadler!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Wenig später sagt sie zum zweiten:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Gratulation, es sind Drillinge!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Was für ein Zufall,","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"meint dieser.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ich arbeite bei Drei M!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Die Krankenschwester geht zum dritten Mann:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Wahnsinn, es sind Vierlinge!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Das gibt's doch nicht,","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"sagt er.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Ich arbeite für Schalke null vier!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der vierte Mann wird plötzlich kreidebleich, hält sich den Kopf","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"und fängt an zu zittern.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"Was ist denn mit Ihnen los?","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"fragen ihn die anderen mitleidig.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich arbeite bei Seven-Eleven!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["muzhik-sosed","devushka","muzhik-ryzhy","paren","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"father","devushka":"nurse","muzhik-ryzhy":"father","paren":"father","muzhik":"father"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["helmet"]},"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["tie"]},"paren":{"clothes":"#1c4fa1"},"muzhik":{"add":["apron"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"couch"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"skeleton"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sit"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"flex"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"},{"type":"line","ref":"l15"},{"type":"line","ref":"l16"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"facepalm"},{"type":"line","ref":"l17"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"shiver"},{"type":"line","ref":"l18"},{"type":"line","ref":"l19"},{"type":"line","ref":"l20"},{"type":"line","ref":"l21"}]}]}
