{"id":"de-witze-1s5wyg5.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1s5wyg5","locale":"en","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Per adaptNote the employers became the Minnesota Twins, 3M, the Four Seasons and 7-Eleven; the rest translated line by line with every narrator cue. Fathers dressed for their jobs (navy team colours, tie, bow tie, shop apron); nurse walks in and over to the third.","title":"The Waiting Room","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["muzhik-sosed","devushka","muzhik-ryzhy","paren","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"father","devushka":"nurse","muzhik-ryzhy":"father","paren":"father","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Four men are sitting in the hospital waiting room while their wives give birth.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The nurse comes to the first one:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Congratulations, you're the father of twins!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"That figures,","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"the man says proudly.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"I work for the Minnesota Twins!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"A little later she says to the second one:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Congratulations, it's triplets!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"What a coincidence,","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"this one says.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"I work at Three M!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The nurse goes to the third man:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"devushka","text":"Incredible, it's quadruplets!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"No way,","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"he says.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"I work at the Four Seasons!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"The fourth man suddenly turns white as chalk, holds his head","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"and starts to tremble.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"paren","text":"What's wrong with you?","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"narrator","text":"the others ask him sympathetically.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I work at Seven-Eleven!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["muzhik-sosed","devushka","muzhik-ryzhy","paren","muzhik"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"father","devushka":"nurse","muzhik-ryzhy":"father","paren":"father","muzhik":"father"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#0c2340"},"muzhik-ryzhy":{"add":["tie"]},"paren":{"add":["bow-tie"]},"muzhik":{"add":["apron"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"couch"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"skeleton"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"paren","act":"sit"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik","act":"sit"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"act","who":"muzhik-sosed","act":"flex"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"ty